            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.71</h2><ul><li>Adds Companion Realtime Voice diagnostics and readiness checks for ffmpeg, whisper-cli, local Whisper models, Ollama/Qwen, and TTS.</li><li>Improves Companion Realtime Voice routing so iPhone app actions stay phone-side while OpenClaw, Hermes, and Mac work route to the selected agent.</li><li>Updates the bundled realtime runtime and fixes the packaged WebSocket dependency advisory.</li></ul>
]]></description>
