            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.70</h2><ul><li>Fixes paired-phone GPT-Realtime-2 OAuth signaling when VoiceClaw sends a phone-minted client secret through the Companion.</li><li>Ensures phone-provided OAuth client secrets use the Realtime ephemeral SDP signaling path instead of the API-key multipart path.</li><li>Keeps existing OpenClaw/Hermes bridge routes and API-key fallback behavior unchanged.</li></ul>
]]></description>
